  "body": "Auction: 34 Shortland Street, City on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nAre you searching for a single-level, two-bedroom unit in prestigious Glendowie - available for immediate possession? This could be the perfect match.\r\n\r\nPositioned quietly at the rear of a boutique block of three, this 1980s brick & tile home sits on a freehold 252m² title (plus 1/3 share of 92m²). The 79m² layout features a functional kitchen with generous open-plan dining and living area opening onto a secluded deck and out to the rear lawn. Both bedrooms are well-proportioned and serviced by a family bathroom plus a convenient separate toilet. A single garage plus space for 2 extra cars completes the package.\r\n\r\nWell-maintained and presented in neat, original condition, it’s ideal for downsizers; retirees; and buyers looking to renovate, add value or undertake a rewarding project.\r\n\r\nWithin easy reach of beaches, shops, reserves, amenities, public transport and in zone for Glendowie College and Primary - the location couldn’t be better!\r\n\r\nThis property must be sold  - you really should see it. So, I’ll see you at the open homes. If you’d like a private viewing or want to know more - call me now!\r\n\r\nPlease visit www.barfoot.co.nz/940797 and scroll down to download or view: Title; LIM (where available); Particulars and Conditions of Sale by Auction (where applicable); and other informative documents\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
